WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.250
The full voting record.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:11.787
109 Members of Parliament voted for both Bill C-14 and Bill C-7 — they legalized MAID and then expanded it to non-terminal conditions.

00:00:11.787 --> 00:00:16.612
46 of those MPs are still serving in the 45th Parliament.

00:00:16.612 --> 00:00:20.262
31 have foreign-born or immigrant connections.

